; 150 was a melee-range sweep, which was survivable for a spell you pick up at level 12
; alongside four others and fatal as the Frostweaver's only spell for the first minute -
; it meant letting every enemy reach arm's length before you could answer. 260 still reads
; as clearly shorter than the 400-450 of the bolt-shaped starters, which is the point of a
; cone: more targets, less reach.
